cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use eDSL in research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "eDSL: Lean 4 models for systems languages, architectures, and operating systems"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formal-verification project planning embedded domain-specific
  languages for GNU C23, GNU C++26, LLVM IR, assembly, and operating-system
  semantics, with compiler-output validation and explicit cost models.
authors:
  - family-names: "Irvinwop"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Irvinwop/eDSL"
url: "https://github.com/Irvinwop/eDSL"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - translation validation
  - operating systems
  - embedded domain-specific languages
